Use the person's height ({{ height_cm }}cm), weight ({{ weight_kg }}kg), and the visible full-body scale to keep all centimeter values realistic.
SizeKorea adult Korean reference values are:
- shoulder width: average 37.1cm, common range about 34.8-39.6cm.
- thigh circumference: average 55.4cm, common range about 48-64cm.
- calf circumference: average 35.9cm, common range about 31-41cm.
- upper-arm circumference: average 29.9cm, common range about 25-35cm.
- thigh length: average 31.2cm, common range about 29.6-32.8cm.
- calf length: average 38.0cm, common range about 35.9-40.0cm.
- torso length: average 45.0cm, common range about 43.1-46.9cm.
- leg length: average 68.4cm, common range about 65.3-71.4cm.
- neck length: average 9.1cm, common range about 8.0-12.0cm.
Do not overestimate small visual segments. For example, neck_length_cm should usually be near 8.0-10.0cm unless the image clearly shows an unusually long or short front neck.

